200&blur=200&s=3f788b9255494df2c5bfdd166ab922a5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8d3ba7fe/uploads/origins/a62c82fe-10b5-494b-9a84-0261ecd0b676?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3f788b9255494df2c5bfdd166ab922a5, https://si.imgix.net/8d3ba7fe/uploads/origins/a62c82fe-10b5-494b-9a84-0261ecd0b676?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a9c9086ce96f481e33d21e42011202bb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8d3ba7fe/uploads/origins/a62c82fe-10b5-494b-9a84-0261ecd0b676?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1d65a3eea10708c0f27e294ec1864443 3x"}, "body": "Hello, your art style is beautiful! I especially love this work you did here (https://skeb.jp/@riituhara/works/11)\n\nI would like to request an illustration of my two vtuber characters. The blue haired one is is a calm and thoughtful idol and her main themes are crystals as well as soft blue and pink tones. The brown/purple haired one is competitive and happy. Please put them in a pose similar to this (https://imgur.com/a/p0oTakb), with the brown/purple haired one having her eyes closed and her head down, and the blue-haired one having her face up with hopeful expression! Feel free to change their outfits to whatever you would like, and if possible, please include a background. \n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/kqYVSwd\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1m3K4T1QccSaPTlWaoyKmeWpPWcuoTqKt?usp=sharing\n\nI would like to use this for Twitch/Twitter/Youtube\nPlease separate the signature layer and the character layers if possible\nThank you!", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@riituhara/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1168820, "client_id": 851778, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ee5f9668/uploads/origins/59fb6790-